## SQ-SPC-01 | seeds tag
@group A
@commands boot; tag probe (`Ingredient.of('#forge:seeds').getStacks()` or `/dumptags`)
@pass `#forge:seeds` contains tobacco, hamimelon and lemon seeds; no Botania mana seed or Mungal spore in it
@fails `tags/misctags.js` line 46 (`farming/crops #13`)
@from batches/r1106spf/b1.qb passed
> zq itemtag forge:seeds
expect itemtag forge:seeds .*the_dirty_stuff:tobacco_seeds|itemtag forge:seeds .*tobacco_seeds
expect itemtag forge:seeds .*hamimelon_seeds
expect itemtag forge:seeds .*lemon_seeds
reject itemtag forge:seeds .*(botania:[a-z_]*mana[a-z_]*seed|mungal)

