## SQ-RW-23 | smoked wood smoking recipes
@group A
@commands boot; recipe id dump for `smoking` outputs of `create_dd:smoked_*`
@pass 13 smoking recipes, cook time 200, one per smoked shape (log, wood, stripped log, stripped wood, planks, slab, stairs, fence, fence gate, door, trapdoor, button, pressure plate); `creativeengineering:smokable/*` tags each hold oak and spruce, none hold `botania:*` or driftwood
@fails `server_scripts/wood/smoked_wood.js`, `tags/wood_tags.js` 36-40 (RW-23)
@from batches/r1031/a1_data.qb
> zq recipes smoked
> zq itemtag creativeengineering:smokable/planks
look 13 smoking recipes, one per smoked shape, cook time 200 (rdetail if unsure); smokable tags hold oak and spruce, no botania:* and no driftwood

